WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:03.920
I've never ridden a bicycle before.

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:06.172
Oh, boy! Even better!

00:00:06.256 --> 00:00:09.843
Brace the bike with your foot
until I get her revved up. Let's go!

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:18.685
Kick off!

00:00:28.236 --> 00:00:30.113
-Should I get off?
-No!

00:00:57.223 --> 00:00:58.641
Go faster! Go!

00:00:58.725 --> 00:01:00.727
That's great! Hang in there!

00:01:04.606 --> 00:01:07.901
Swing your body to the inside
when we go around the bend.

00:01:07.984 --> 00:01:10.278
Otherwise, it won't turn very well.

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:13.907
Now!

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:19.079
Great! You're doing fine!

00:01:28.671 --> 00:01:30.632
Yippee! Great!

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:42.769
-The dirigible, right?
-Right.

00:01:51.986 --> 00:01:53.196
We're flying!

